      "text": "buryingplace with you, that I may bury my dead, Gen. 23:4. not a house where there was not one dead, Ex. 12:30. saw the Egyptians dead upon the sea shore, Ex. 14:30. he stood between the dead and the living, Num. 16:48. that toucheth the dead body … shall be unclean, Num. 19:11. wife of the dead shall not marry … a stranger, Deut. 25:5. saw their champion was dead, 1 Sam. 17:51. Samuel was dead, 1 Sam. 28:3. laid her dead child in my bosom, 1 Kgs. 3:20. when Elisha was come … the child was dead, 2 Kgs. 4:32. shew wonders to the dead? shall the dead arise, Ps. 88:10. the dead know not any thing, Eccl. 9:5.",
